OL,3,GNEWSAVillagers fight to keep art of
OL,4,Abell-ringing alive
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor centuries the sound of bells has
OL,7,Frung out across an English village, but
OL,8,Fresidents say they are now fighting to
OL,9,Fkeep the tradition alive.
OL,11,FDespite a lengthy restoration project
OL,12,Fon the bells at their local church, the
OL,13,Fpeople of Elmley Castle,
OL,14,FWorcestershire, fear that without young
OL,15,Fpeople getting involved the art of
OL,16,Fbell-ringing will die out.
OL,18,FSome of the bells at the St Mary the
OL,19,FVirgin Church date back to the 1400s,
OL,20,Fwith volunteer bell-ringers gathering
OL,21,Feach Wednesday to hone their craft.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
